386:## Walker-feel (18 Nov 2026): a person's body moves by velocity (terrain/world_body.gd, which uses this space's tests).
387:## One call per world tick; see world_body.gd for the numbers.
388:func drive(from: Vector3, wish: Vector3, jump: bool, slide: bool) -> Dictionary:
389:	if _mover == null:
390:		_mover = Mover.new(self)
391:	return _mover.drive(from, wish, jump, slide)
