324:## Where a surface of this material goes in the stand-in: the palette material into the first surface, another material
325:## of the toon shader (TLStyle.flat_material: the kernel's boxes and balls, in one colour) into a surface of its own,
326:## anything else (glass, water, a pack's own material) nowhere.

