103:## The meshes of the merged pictures (main thread), placed, kept, and written to the picture cache (`_cache_save`).
104:## `main_us`: the part of the walk that ran on the main thread in the frame the build started.
105:func _finish_pictures(e: Dictionary, accs: Array, t0: int, main_us: int) -> void:
106:	var t1: int = Time.get_ticks_usec()
107:	var holder: Node3D = e["holder"] if is_instance_valid(e["holder"]) else null
