codex
The headless runs confirmed that both collider-copy paths lose a platform after its source pack unloads. I also reproduced a visitor staying grounded on a 65° bank and a completed slide emitting a second `end_slide` event at a later ledge. I’m now checking how the draw layer decides where to cut holes in the terrain.
